                        


Item #:  SCP-5133

Object Class:  Keter

Special Containment Procedures:  SCP-5133 is to be kept in a 5 x 5 x 2.5 cell suspended in a vacuum via electromagnets. It is to be monitored via a wireless camera at all times.

In the event of a containment breach, special tranquillisers are to be used against it as they have shown effective in temporarily neutralising it.

Description:  SCP-5133 is a Caucasian human female of average weight and size and unknown age, though it claims to be ███ years old.

SCP-5133 is able to create portals at will, via a ball of energy with approximately a 15cm radius that travels at ████ km/h known as SCP-5133-1, which can travel infinitely in a straight line as long as there is matter in its path until it reaches it's destination, where it turns into an instance of SCP-5133-2 and creates another instance of SCP-5133-2 at SCP-5133's Current destination

SCP-5133-2 is a portal which if walked through by SCP-5133 it instantly transports it to its corresponding twin portal created at the same time. They are attached via a pocket dimension where time is stopped (See Interview-5133-A). Walking through the portal by other subjects has resulted in coming out of the other side of the same portal they walked in.

SCP-5133 has shown no signs of ageing since it was originally contained on ██/██/20██ and general compliance with containment, but will occasionally enter a rage state for unknown reasons, going into a portal, disappearing and reappearing with a blade that expunges solids and liquids from existence (SCP-5133-3). attempts to break SCP-5133-3 have been so far unsuccessful due to its nature and its handle has shown indestructible. Also, If SCP-5133 is knocked unconscious, SCP-5133-3 will teleport into a portal.

Addendum: 

Interview-5133-A


 

Dr. ██████:  Okay, This is Dr. ██████ with interview-5133-A of SCP-5133

SCP-5133:  Please, Call me █████.

Dr. ██████:  I am afraid I have to call you SCP-5133.

SCP-5133:  Okay then.

Dr. ██████:  When did your abilities first manifest?

SCP-5133:  When I was ██ I think. it was about ███ years ago so my memory has gone a bit fuzzy.

Dr. ██████:  Ok, Where did you find SCP-5133-3?

SCP-5133:  Where did I find what?

Dr. ██████:  Your sword.

SCP-5133:  Oh that old thing. I found it about ███ years ago, while travelling through a portal and it was just there. It had not been there before but then it was there, out of nowhere.

Dr. ██████:  Thank you. How do you create the portals?

SCP-5133:  I am not fully sure myself, I usually think of where i want to go and one appears but sometimes one appears without me thinking about it.

Dr. ██████:  Thank you. I think we are done here.

 

Closing Statement:  Dr. ██████ left the room and SCP-5133 was successfully returned to containment.








                    

                                    





            
    

                    



                    
                        
                            
